{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"`We got some good info. We might be able to move up schedule and sort it sooner than evening.`","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:10:35.017000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877192691128094801","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"We talked with a member of Ferrytown's council about the borough, and I think we managed to ask all the questions we needed to ask.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:12:30.924000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877193177277268048","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"he nods","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:13:23.296000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877193396941357076","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"`Ah, Sab's done hydrating. I'll switch out with her, go look for Ed and Fuddles.` they fly out.","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:13:45.894000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877193491724251149","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Sabrine walks in. 'He said 'we', but he did most of the good questions.'","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:14:57.663000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877193792745242636","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Well he is my successor, so I hope he gets comfortable delving for important information\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:15:35.774000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877193952594382869","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"she nods. 'I'll offer all the support I can.'","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:18:10.805000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877194602841526354","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Well your future is more in spreading the faith..... anyway... what did you discover?\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:18:53.872000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877194783477624914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"(V's collecting all the info together, so I won't interfere with that)\nSabrine nods at Roy. 'You tell him, and I'll try and think of potential wording?'","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:20:22.856000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877195156703572039","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Well, it took me a bit to think of the best way to phrase all our questions without having to either lie or disclose any secrets, I hope that got us what we need.\"\n\n\"We talked with Sutri, one of the two of the council who care for a group of shifter children - both to get answers from a prominent member of the community, and someone who took responsibility of caring for the future.\"\n\n\"They definitely value their community a lot - in fact, somewhere through the conversation I realized that what we wrote on the stone here might fit just as well to Feytown by itself. Maybe out of necessity, or maybe out of some greater desire, many races from both this plane and Feywild came together to form one family there. Well, of course, there are... some exceptions we could mention, but that's not the time for them. This is mostly my view, but Feytown seems to be a bit of an idealized miniature of Arcania as a whole - we too, in response to circumstances, band together regardless of our origins.\"\n\n\"But besides the focus on the family, there's another thing quite visible in them - they're determined, they're not giving up. We've learned that the bleeds are a one-way passage, and they haven't had much success in circumventing it, though they're still trying to find a solution. People led by the twins - the Feytown council ones, not the Ravens - fought against the redcoats' iron cage. Even though many can't go back to their home lands, they adapted and keep doing their best for their future.\"\n\n\"Perhaps that's something we can focus on - changes on their own weren't the best idea, but adapting to them, determination, and working for everyone's future.\"\n\n\"As for the place, Cael'fii, the mother-tree, and the park surrounding it, they're important to the borough to warrant that name, but not completely closed off to visitors, would be my first guess. After that, the hilltops where the children - the future - live.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:39:06.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877199869465468948","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"The Mender sits and thinks about what was said.","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:44:47.195000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877201298586468422","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'Working from his conclusions there, I have some ideas for wording, though they'll likely need adjusting.'","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:45:16.197000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877201420229693490","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Just asking a high-ranked member of the community right off the bat where Feytown's heart is would probably not have gotten me too far, I tried to lead the discussion naturally to still get as much as I could out of it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:46:37.200000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877201759980912641","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"A bit of it still might be also based on my previous interactions with the locals - like the said children, or the craftsperson who started making really well working firearms out of wood.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:48:03.037000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877202120007376946","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Sabrine nods and carefully shows her wooden revolver. 'This is... a good compromise for me. And it works very well.'","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:48:35.628000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877202256703942687","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"I don't wish to cause an issue with the mother tree... since that is more holy to them it seems... but the Bleeds are a part of their identity.... I was there on the hilltops where I repaired that rip..... I think that's where we go.... they have had many battles fought on their edges.... but those two rips were fought at the core of their community....  I think we look at the hilltops for location.\"  He pauses \"What are you thinking for words?  I will see if any resonate\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:49:47.528000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877202558274379826","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'I've got four strings to use as a base...'","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:50:12.906000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877202664717418526","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"she takes a deep breath.\n'Diversity brings strength\nto adapt to the changes of nature,\nand to work for the future as one.'\n\n'Within people's differences\nlies the strength to adapt\nand to help others\nfor the sake of our future.'\n\n'While people may differ\nthe spirit of unity\nlives within us all\nand fights for the future.'\n\n'Against all odds\nwe fight together\nadapting to change\nand building our future.'","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:50:27.335000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877202725237035049","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"I agree, I don't think they would appreciate carving words into the tree itself - I was more thinking somewhere in its park, but the hilltops should be good as well, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:51:04.206000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877202879885238275","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"He seems deep in thought. nodding to Sabs words contemplating what she is saying","created_at":"2021-08-17T14:53:42.449000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877203543604482079","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"We don't want to add change to their already changing nature.... we need to amplify what they do well, and minimize that which can get out of hand.\" He pauses \n\n\"Just as order can be found in chaos, the strength of a community comes from its diverse people.  A society is the amalgamation of minds, values, hopes, and histories, so that no matter what price is asked, the community becomes stronger than iron.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T15:05:22.722000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877206480762318899","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"she winces slightly at the mention of iron. 'I agree. If everyone's the same, then if a situation comes up one person can't deal with, then no one will be able to.'","created_at":"2021-08-17T15:06:38.024000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877206796601806848","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'That's the general idea I was going for, anyway.'","created_at":"2021-08-17T15:08:07.367000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877207171333517352","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Right.... I used what you said to come up with my Idea.  What do you two think?\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T15:09:49.363000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877207599135752192","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"(oh, I misinterpreted it as a commentary because it was longer than I was expecting, rip)","created_at":"2021-08-17T15:10:14.961000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877207706501529750","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
